<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh November forex reserves at $1.88 bln.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh November forex reserves at $1.88 bln.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh's foreign exchange reserves fell to $1.88 billion at the end of November from $2.02 billion in October, central bank officials said.</p>
<p>The reserves were $2.37 billion in November, 1995.</p>
<p>Foreign exchange reserves (month):</p>
<p>(in billion dollar)</p>
<p>    November	    October	 November 95</p>
<p>     $1.88		 $2.02	     $2.37</p>
</text>
